d Orthognathic Surgery Coordination\" were rendering\r\n          on a single line, which made the card wider than its grid column and\r\n          pushed it past the edge of the page. The name now wraps, the card\r\n          can never exceed its track, and breakpoints run from 320px to\r\n          1600px and up. Nothing on the page can leave its box.\r\n\r\n     Contents:\r\n       1. Hero\r\n       2. Sticky specialty index (live search + 14 category chips)\r\n       3. Fourteen specialty sections, 172 treatments in total\r\n       4. Detail popup, opened by clicking any treatment\r\n       5. Closing CTA\r\n       6. Page script (self contained, does not touch header.html)\r\n\r\n     Notes for editing:\r\n       - Icons are limited to the Font Awesome subset already embedded in\r\n         header.html. Do not introduce new icon names without adding the glyph.\r\n       - The section IDs below are linked from the header mega menu. Keep them.\r\n       - --bb-nav is the fixed header height used for sticky offset and\r\n         anchor scroll. Change that ONE value if the header height changes.\r\n       - House rule: no em dashes or en dashes anywhere in the copy. -->\r\n\r\n<main id=\"top\" data-bb=\"page\" data-bbsvc=\"\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:2\">\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n\/* the search glyph is the only icon this page needs that is not already in\r\n   the header subset, so it is declared here and nowhere else *\/\r\n.fa-magnifying-glass:before{content:\"\\f002\"}\r\n\r\n\/* ---- page scoped styles. Prefixed data attributes only, nothing global ----\r\n   --bb-nav is the fixed header height. It drives the sticky offset of the\r\n   index bar AND the scroll-margin of every section, so an anchor from the\r\n   header mega menu lands cleanly under the header. Change this ONE value if\r\n   the header height ever changes. *\/\r\n[data-bbsvc]{--bb-nav:78px}\r\n@media (max-width:680px){[data-bbsvc]{--bb-nav:70px}}\r\n[data-bbsvc] [data-svcsection]{scroll-marg