sthetic-dentistry\" data-chipfor=\"aesthetic-dentistry\"><b>13<\/b>Aesthetic and Cosmetic Dentistry<\/a>\r\n<a data-svcchip=\"\" href=\"#comprehensive-care\" data-chipfor=\"comprehensive-care\"><b>14<\/b>Comprehensive Dental Care<\/a>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcnav=\"next\" aria-label=\"Scroll specialties right\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/i><\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== 01. Orthodontics ===== -->\r\n<section id=\"orthodontics\" data-svcsection=\"\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\" style=\"padding:clamp(48px,6vw,78px) 0;position:relative\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:1340px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px\">\r\n<div data-reveal=\"\" data-cathead=\"\">\r\n<span data-catnum=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01<\/span>\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0\">\r\n<h2 data-cattitle=\"\">Orthodontics<\/h2>\r\n<div data-catmeta=\"\">\r\n<span data-catcount=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-teeth\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>16 treatments<\/span>\r\n<span data-cattag=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\" style=\"font-size:8px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>Core specialty<\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p data-catlead=\"\">Braces, aligners and jaw alignment for children, teenagers and adults, planned case by case.<\/p>\r\n<span data-catrule=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div data-svcgridx=\"\" data-reveal=\"\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"metal-fixed-braces\" data-title=\"Metal Fixed Braces\" data-desc=\"Fixed appliances bonded to the teeth and adjusted at regular intervals to move teeth into a planned position. They remain a dependable option for a wide range of alignment and bite concerns.\" data-pts=\"Suitable for most case types | Adjusted at routine visits | Retention follows active treatment\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Metal Fixed Braces<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"ceramic-aesthetic-braces\" data-title=\"Ceramic and Aesthetic Braces\" data-desc=\"Fixed braces using tooth coloured or ceramic brackets, so the appliance is less visible while treatment continues in the same way as conventional braces.\" data-pts=\"Less visible than metal brackets | Same clinical approach as fixed braces | Care advice given for staining\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Ceramic and Aesthetic Braces<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"self-ligating-braces\" data-title=\"Self-Ligating Braces\" data-desc=\"Fixed braces that hold the wire with a built in clip rather than elastic ties. Suitability is decided by the clinical findings rather than by preference alone.\" data-pts=\"No elastic ties on the brackets | Discussed as one option among several | Reviewed at regular appointments\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Self-Ligating Braces<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"clear-aligners\" data-title=\"Clear Aligners\" data-desc=\"A series of removable clear trays that move teeth in planned stages. Aligners suit selected cases and depend on consistent daily wear to work as planned.\" data-pts=\"Removable for eating and cleaning | Requires disciplined wear time | Not suitable for every case\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Clear Aligners<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"early-interceptive-orthodontics\" data-title=\"Early and Interceptive Orthodontics\" data-desc=\"Assessment and, where indicated, early treatment while a child is still growing. The aim is to guide development and reduce the complexity of later treatment.\" data-pts=\"Timed around growth and eruption | Assessment does not always mean treatment | May shorten later treatment\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Early and Interceptive Orthodontics<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"functional-jaw-orthopedics\" data-title=\"Functional Jaw Orthopedics and Growth Modification\" data-desc=\"Appliances used during growth to influence the relationship between the upper and lower jaws, usually alongside or before fixed appliance treatment.\" data-pts=\"Best suited to growing patients | Often a first phase of treatment | Progress monitored closely\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Functional Jaw Orthopedics and Growth Modification<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"space-maintainers-habit-appliances\" data-title=\"Space Maintainers and Habit-Breaking Appliances\" data-desc=\"Appliances that hold space after early tooth loss, or that help stop habits such as thumb sucking and tongue thrusting which can affect the developing bite.\" data-pts=\"Holds space for adult teeth | Supports habit correction | Simple, regularly reviewed appliances\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Space Maintainers and Habit-Breaking Appliances<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"impacted-tooth-management\" data-title=\"Impacted Tooth Management\" data-desc=\"Diagnosis and management of teeth that fail to erupt into position, often combining orthodontic traction with surgical exposure where that is required.\" data-pts=\"Located with radiographs or CBCT | May need surgical exposure | Guided into position over time\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Impacted Tooth Management<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"surgical-orthodontics\" data-title=\"Surgical Orthodontics\" data-desc=\"Orthodontic treatment planned together with jaw surgery for cases where the underlying skeletal relationship cannot be corrected by tooth movement alone.\" data-pts=\"Joint orthodontic and surgical planning | Preparation before and after surgery | Detailed records at every stage\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Surgical Orthodontics<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"cleft-lip-palate-orthodontics\" data-title=\"Cleft Lip and Palate Orthodontic Management\" data-desc=\"Long term orthodontic care for patients with cleft lip and palate, coordinated with the wider team involved in their treatment over several stages of growth.\" data-pts=\"Care staged across growth | Coordinated with other specialties | Long term follow up\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Cleft Lip and Palate Orthodontic Management<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"class-ii-class-iii-management\" data-title=\"Class II and Class III Skeletal Case Management\" data-desc=\"Assessment and treatment planning where the upper and lower jaws sit in a marked forward or backward relationship, using growth modification, camouflage or surgery as appropriate.\" data-pts=\"Skeletal analysis before planning | Growth, camouflage or surgical routes | Options explained in full\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Class II and Class III Skeletal Case Management<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"open-bite-deep-bite-correction\" data-title=\"Open Bite and Deep Bite Correction\" data-desc=\"Correction of bites where the front teeth do not meet, or where they overlap excessively. Planning looks at the cause as well as the tooth positions.\" data-pts=\"Cause identified before treatment | Function as well as appearance | Retention protects the result\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Open Bite and Deep Bite Correction<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"complex-multidisciplinary-cases\" data-title=\"Complex Multidisciplinary Orthodontic Cases\" data-desc=\"Cases that need orthodontic treatment alongside surgical, restorative or periodontal care, sequenced so each stage supports the next.\" data-pts=\"One coordinated treatment plan | Clear order of treatment stages | Shared clinical records\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Complex Multidisciplinary Orthodontic Cases<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"syndromic-craniofacial-orthodontics\" data-title=\"Syndromic Craniofacial Orthodontic Management\" data-desc=\"Orthodontic care for patients with craniofacial syndromes, planned with realistic goals and close attention to growth, function and long term stability.\" data-pts=\"Individual goals set case by case | Growth followed over years | Team based approach\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Syndromic Craniofacial Orthodontic Management<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"retainers-long-term-retention\" data-title=\"Retainers and Long-Term Retention\" data-desc=\"Fixed or removable retainers worn after active treatment. Retention is a permanent part of orthodontic care because teeth can move throughout life.\" data-pts=\"Fixed or removable options | Fitted as treatment ends | Reviewed at follow up visits\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Retainers and Long-Term Retention<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"digital-orthodontic-planning\" data-title=\"Digital Orthodontic Planning and 3D Simulation\" data-desc=\"Digital scans and three dimensional planning used to study tooth movement before treatment begins and to explain the proposed plan clearly.\" data-pts=\"Scans instead of putty impressions | Plan reviewed in three dimensions | Simulation is a plan, not a promise\" data-cat=\"Orthodontics\" data-catn=\"01\" data-catid=\"orthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Digital Orthodontic Planning and 3D Simulation<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== 02. Restorative and Endodontics ===== -->\r\n<section id=\"restorative-endodontics\" data-svcsection=\"\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\" style=\"background:#F7F4EC;padding:clamp(48px,6vw,78px) 0;position:relative\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:1340px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px\">\r\n<div data-reveal=\"\" data-cathead=\"\">\r\n<span data-catnum=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02<\/span>\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0\">\r\n<h2 data-cattitle=\"\">Restorative and Endodontics<\/h2>\r\n<div data-catmeta=\"\">\r\n<span data-catcount=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-tooth\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>17 treatments<\/span>\r\n<span data-cattag=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\" style=\"font-size:8px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>Core specialty<\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p data-catlead=\"\">Repairing damaged teeth and treating the tooth from the inside, so a natural tooth can be kept wherever possible.<\/p>\r\n<span data-catrule=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div data-svcgridx=\"\" data-reveal=\"\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"composite-bonding\" data-title=\"Composite Bonding\" data-desc=\"Tooth coloured composite applied directly to repair chips, close small gaps or reshape a tooth, usually in a single visit and with minimal removal of tooth structure.\" data-pts=\"Often completed in one visit | Conserves natural tooth | Shade matched to your teeth\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Composite Bonding<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"tooth-colored-restorations\" data-title=\"Tooth-Colored Restorations\" data-desc=\"Fillings that restore decayed or worn teeth using materials matched to the natural tooth shade rather than metal.\" data-pts=\"Matched to surrounding teeth | Bonded to tooth structure | Checked at routine reviews\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Tooth-Colored Restorations<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"diastema-closure\" data-title=\"Diastema Closure\" data-desc=\"Closing a gap between teeth using composite bonding, veneers or orthodontics, depending on the size of the space and the cause behind it.\" data-pts=\"Cause assessed first | Bonding, veneers or braces | Result planned before starting\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Diastema Closure<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"tooth-reshaping-contouring\" data-title=\"Tooth Reshaping and Contouring\" data-desc=\"Small adjustments to the edges or surfaces of teeth to improve their proportion and how they sit together, done conservatively within safe limits.\" data-pts=\"Very small amounts adjusted | Quick and usually painless | Often paired with bonding\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Tooth Reshaping and Contouring<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"teeth-whitening-bleaching\" data-title=\"Teeth Whitening and Bleaching\" data-desc=\"Professionally supervised whitening after a check of gum and tooth health. Results vary between patients and depend on the cause of discolouration.\" data-pts=\"Assessment before treatment | Supervised, measured process | Results vary between patients\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Teeth Whitening and Bleaching<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"internal-bleaching\" data-title=\"Internal Bleaching of Discolored Teeth\" data-desc=\"Whitening carried out from inside a root treated tooth that has darkened, so the shade is improved without treating the neighbouring teeth.\" data-pts=\"For root treated, darkened teeth | Treats one tooth at a time | Reviewed over several visits\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Internal Bleaching of Discolored Teeth<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"dental-trauma-restoration\" data-title=\"Dental Trauma Restoration\" data-desc=\"Rebuilding teeth that have been chipped, fractured or displaced by injury, restoring both appearance and function once the tooth has been assessed.\" data-pts=\"Injury assessed before repair | Function and appearance restored | Tooth vitality monitored\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Dental Trauma Restoration<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"replacement-failing-restorations\" data-title=\"Replacement of Failing Restorations\" data-desc=\"Assessment and replacement of old fillings, crowns or bonding that have worn, stained, leaked or fractured.\" data-pts=\"Existing work assessed fully | Decay underneath addressed | Replaced with a durable option\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Replacement of Failing Restorations<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"minimally-invasive-dentistry\" data-title=\"Minimally Invasive Aesthetic Dentistry\" data-desc=\"An approach that removes as little natural tooth as possible while still achieving a stable, good looking result.\" data-pts=\"Conserves healthy tooth structure | Adhesive techniques where possible | Long term durability considered\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Minimally Invasive Aesthetic Dentistry<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"digital-shade-matching\" data-title=\"Digital Shade Matching\" data-desc=\"Shade selection supported by digital tools and controlled lighting so new restorations blend with the surrounding teeth.\" data-pts=\"Objective shade reading | Reduces guesswork | Checked before final fitting\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Digital Shade Matching<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"cad-cam-restorations\" data-title=\"CAD\/CAM Restorations\" data-desc=\"Crowns, inlays and onlays designed digitally and milled or printed to fit, using a scan of your tooth rather than a conventional impression.\" data-pts=\"Digital scan, digital design | Precise, repeatable fit | Fewer conventional impressions\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">CAD\/CAM Restorations<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"root-canal-treatment\" data-title=\"Conventional Root Canal Treatment\" data-desc=\"Treatment of an infected or inflamed nerve inside a tooth. The canal system is cleaned, shaped and sealed so the natural tooth can be kept.\" data-pts=\"Carried out under local anaesthesia | Saves the natural tooth | Usually restored with a crown\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Conventional Root Canal Treatment<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"root-canal-retreatment\" data-title=\"Root Canal Re-Treatment\" data-desc=\"Repeat root canal treatment when a previously treated tooth remains symptomatic or shows signs of persistent infection.\" data-pts=\"Previous treatment reviewed | Canals recleaned and resealed | Alternative options discussed\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Root Canal Re-Treatment<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"calcified-curved-canals\" data-title=\"Management of Calcified and Curved Canals\" data-desc=\"Treatment of narrowed, blocked or sharply curved canals that need magnification, careful instrumentation and additional planning time.\" data-pts=\"Detailed imaging beforehand | Magnification and fine instruments | Longer appointment time\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Management of Calcified and Curved Canals<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"separated-instrument-management\" data-title=\"Separated Instrument Management\" data-desc=\"Assessment and management of a fractured instrument left inside a root canal, including removal, bypass or monitoring depending on the situation.\" data-pts=\"Position confirmed with imaging | Removal, bypass or review | Prognosis explained honestly\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Separated Instrument Management<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"apical-surgery\" data-title=\"Apical Surgery\" data-desc=\"A small surgical procedure at the root tip when infection persists after root canal treatment and re-treatment is not suitable.\" data-pts=\"Considered after non-surgical options | Treats the root tip directly | Healing followed up over months\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Apical Surgery<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"resorption-management\" data-title=\"Internal and External Resorption Management\" data-desc=\"Diagnosis and management of resorption, where tooth structure is lost from inside or outside the root, often found on a routine radiograph.\" data-pts=\"Detected with radiographs or CBCT | Progress monitored carefully | Treatment depends on the extent\" data-cat=\"Restorative and Endodontics\" data-catn=\"02\" data-catid=\"restorative-endodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Internal and External Resorption Management<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== 03. Prosthodontics ===== -->\r\n<section id=\"prosthodontics\" data-svcsection=\"\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\" style=\"padding:clamp(48px,6vw,78px) 0;position:relative\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:1340px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px\">\r\n<div data-reveal=\"\" data-cathead=\"\">\r\n<span data-catnum=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03<\/span>\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0\">\r\n<h2 data-cattitle=\"\">Prosthodontics<\/h2>\r\n<div data-catmeta=\"\">\r\n<span data-catcount=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-crown\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>16 treatments<\/span>\r\n<span data-cattag=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\" style=\"font-size:8px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>Core specialty<\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p data-catlead=\"\">Replacing missing or heavily damaged teeth with implants, crowns, bridges and dentures planned for function and appearance.<\/p>\r\n<span data-catrule=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div data-svcgridx=\"\" data-reveal=\"\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"dental-implants\" data-title=\"Single and Multiple Dental Implants\" data-desc=\"Titanium implants placed into the jaw to support a crown or bridge where one or more teeth are missing. Suitability depends on bone volume and gum health.\" data-pts=\"Assessment and imaging first | Healing period before the crown | Gum and bone health essential\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Single and Multiple Dental Implants<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"full-arch-implant-rehabilitation\" data-title=\"Full-Arch Implant Rehabilitation\" data-desc=\"A fixed replacement for a complete arch of teeth supported by a planned number of implants, restoring chewing function and facial support.\" data-pts=\"Planned digitally before surgery | Fixed, not removable | Staged over several appointments\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Full-Arch Implant Rehabilitation<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"implant-supported-overdentures\" data-title=\"Implant-Supported Overdentures\" data-desc=\"A removable denture that clips onto implants for markedly better stability than a conventional denture, while still being taken out for cleaning.\" data-pts=\"Far more stable than a plain denture | Removable for cleaning | Attachments serviced over time\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Implant-Supported Overdentures<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"implant-supported-fixed-prostheses\" data-title=\"Implant-Supported Fixed Prostheses\" data-desc=\"Crowns or bridges fixed permanently onto implants, cleaned in the mouth like natural teeth and reviewed at maintenance visits.\" data-pts=\"Stays fixed in the mouth | Cleaned daily like natural teeth | Regular maintenance reviews\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Implant-Supported Fixed Prostheses<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"immediate-implant-placement\" data-title=\"Immediate Implant Placement\" data-desc=\"Placing an implant at the same appointment as a tooth is removed, where the site and bone conditions allow it.\" data-pts=\"Fewer surgical appointments | Depends on the socket condition | Not suitable in every case\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Immediate Implant Placement<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"implant-crowns-bridges\" data-title=\"Implant Crowns and Bridges\" data-desc=\"The visible restoration fitted onto healed implants, designed to match the shape, shade and bite of the surrounding teeth.\" data-pts=\"Shade and shape matched | Bite checked and adjusted | Fitted after healing is confirmed\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Implant Crowns and Bridges<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"digital-implant-planning\" data-title=\"Digital Implant Planning\" data-desc=\"Implant positions planned on a three dimensional scan before surgery, taking bone, nerves and the final restoration into account.\" data-pts=\"CBCT based planning | Restoration led positioning | Reduces surgical guesswork\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Digital Implant Planning<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"guided-implant-surgery\" data-title=\"Guided Implant Surgery\" data-desc=\"Implant placement using a printed surgical guide made from the digital plan, so the implant follows the position that was planned.\" data-pts=\"Printed guide from the digital plan | Accurate, planned positioning | Often a shorter procedure\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Guided Implant Surgery<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"bone-grafting-sinus-augmentation\" data-title=\"Bone Grafting and Sinus Augmentation\" data-desc=\"Procedures that rebuild bone volume where it is insufficient for an implant, including lifting the sinus floor in the upper back jaw.\" data-pts=\"Creates support for implants | Healing time before implants | Assessed on a CBCT scan\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Bone Grafting and Sinus Augmentation<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"removable-partial-dentures\" data-title=\"Removable Partial Dentures\" data-desc=\"A removable replacement for several missing teeth, designed to distribute load sensibly and protect the remaining natural teeth.\" data-pts=\"Replaces several teeth at once | Protects remaining teeth | Adjusted after fitting\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Removable Partial Dentures<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"complete-dentures\" data-title=\"Complete Dentures\" data-desc=\"A full removable set of teeth for one or both jaws, made in stages with try in appointments before the final fit.\" data-pts=\"Made in planned stages | Try in before finishing | Reviewed and adjusted after fitting\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Complete Dentures<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"immediate-dentures\" data-title=\"Immediate Dentures\" data-desc=\"A denture prepared in advance and fitted on the day teeth are removed, so you are not left without teeth while the gums heal.\" data-pts=\"Fitted on extraction day | Gums change while healing | Relines or a new denture later\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Immediate Dentures<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"overdentures\" data-title=\"Overdentures\" data-desc=\"A denture that sits over retained roots or implants for extra stability and better preservation of the underlying bone.\" data-pts=\"More stable than a plain denture | Preserves bone underneath | Needs careful daily cleaning\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Overdentures<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"maxillofacial-prostheses\" data-title=\"Maxillofacial Prostheses\" data-desc=\"Custom prostheses that restore areas lost to surgery, trauma or a developmental condition, made and fitted in coordinated stages.\" data-pts=\"Made individually for each patient | Coordinated with surgical care | Reviewed over the long term\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Maxillofacial Prostheses<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"obturators\" data-title=\"Obturators for Maxillary Defects\" data-desc=\"A prosthesis that seals a defect in the upper jaw or palate, supporting speech, swallowing and eating.\" data-pts=\"Supports speech and eating | Fitted and refined in stages | Adjusted as healing progresses\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Obturators for Maxillary Defects<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"prosthetic-rehabilitation\" data-title=\"Prosthetic Rehabilitation\" data-desc=\"Comprehensive rebuilding of a worn, damaged or heavily restored dentition, planned as a whole rather than tooth by tooth.\" data-pts=\"Whole mouth planning | Bite assessed before treatment | Sequenced over several stages\" data-cat=\"Prosthodontics\" data-catn=\"03\" data-catid=\"prosthodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Prosthetic Rehabilitation<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== 04. Periodontics ===== -->\r\n<section id=\"periodontics\" data-svcsection=\"\" data-catid=\"periodontics\" style=\"background:#F7F4EC;padding:clamp(48px,6vw,78px) 0;position:relative\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:1340px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px\">\r\n<div data-reveal=\"\" data-cathead=\"\">\r\n<span data-catnum=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04<\/span>\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0\">\r\n<h2 data-cattitle=\"\">Periodontics<\/h2>\r\n<div data-catmeta=\"\">\r\n<span data-catcount=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-shield-heart\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>14 treatments<\/span>\r\n<span data-cattag=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\" style=\"font-size:8px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>Core specialty<\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p data-catlead=\"\">Gum and bone health, the foundation every tooth and implant depends on.<\/p>\r\n<span data-catrule=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div data-svcgridx=\"\" data-reveal=\"\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"periodontal-assessment\" data-title=\"Comprehensive Periodontal Assessment\" data-desc=\"A detailed examination of the gums and supporting bone, including pocket measurements and radiographs, recorded as a baseline for future comparison.\" data-pts=\"Full pocket charting | Radiographic bone assessment | Baseline for future reviews\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Comprehensive Periodontal Assessment<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"periodontal-maintenance\" data-title=\"Periodontal Maintenance\" data-desc=\"Planned recall appointments after gum treatment to keep the condition stable, since periodontal disease is managed over the long term.\" data-pts=\"Scheduled recall intervals | Stability checked each visit | Home care reviewed together\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Periodontal Maintenance<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"deep-pocket-management\" data-title=\"Deep Periodontal Pocket Management\" data-desc=\"Cleaning below the gum line to remove deposits from deep pockets, usually with local anaesthesia and over more than one appointment.\" data-pts=\"Carried out under local anaesthesia | Often split across visits | Response reassessed afterwards\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Deep Periodontal Pocket Management<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"periodontal-flap-surgery\" data-title=\"Periodontal Flap Surgery\" data-desc=\"Surgical access to clean root surfaces and reshape bone where deep pockets have not responded to non-surgical treatment.\" data-pts=\"For pockets that remain deep | Direct access to root surfaces | Healing reviewed closely\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Periodontal Flap Surgery<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"regenerative-periodontal-procedures\" data-title=\"Regenerative Periodontal Procedures\" data-desc=\"Procedures that aim to regain some of the bone and attachment lost to periodontal disease in suitable defect shapes.\" data-pts=\"Suited to selected defects | Graft materials may be used | Outcome depends on healing\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Regenerative Periodontal Procedures<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"periodontal-bone-grafting\" data-title=\"Bone Grafting\" data-desc=\"Grafting to rebuild bone lost around teeth or implants, supporting the tissues and improving the site for further treatment.\" data-pts=\"Rebuilds lost support | Materials chosen per case | Healing takes several months\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Bone Grafting<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"guided-tissue-regeneration\" data-title=\"Guided Tissue Regeneration\" data-desc=\"A membrane is used to direct healing so the right tissues regrow in the right place around a tooth.\" data-pts=\"Membrane guides the healing | Used with grafting | Careful aftercare needed\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Guided Tissue Regeneration<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"gingival-grafting\" data-title=\"Gingival Grafting\" data-desc=\"Grafting to thicken thin gum tissue or cover exposed root surfaces, improving comfort and long term protection.\" data-pts=\"Covers exposed roots | Thickens thin gum tissue | Reduces sensitivity in many cases\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Gingival Grafting<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"gingival-recession-management\" data-title=\"Management of Gingival Recession\" data-desc=\"Identifying why the gum has receded, then treating the cause and, where indicated, restoring the lost tissue.\" data-pts=\"Cause identified first | Brushing technique reviewed | Grafting where appropriate\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Management of Gingival Recession<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"esthetic-periodontal-surgery\" data-title=\"Esthetic Periodontal Surgery\" data-desc=\"Reshaping gum contours so the gum line frames the teeth evenly, planned alongside any restorative or orthodontic work.\" data-pts=\"Planned with the final smile | Symmetry assessed carefully | Healing before final restorations\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Esthetic Periodontal Surgery<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"gum-depigmentation\" data-title=\"Gum Depigmentation\" data-desc=\"A procedure that reduces natural dark pigmentation in the gums for a more even appearance. It is elective and always optional.\" data-pts=\"Purely elective procedure | Discussed openly beforehand | Pigmentation can return over time\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Gum Depigmentation<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"crown-lengthening-perio\" data-title=\"Crown Lengthening\" data-desc=\"Adjusting gum and bone level to expose more tooth, either for a restoration to be placed properly or to even out a gummy smile.\" data-pts=\"Functional or aesthetic reasons | Healing before restoration | Planned with the restoring clinician\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Crown Lengthening<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"peri-implantitis-management\" data-title=\"Peri-Implantitis Management\" data-desc=\"Treatment of inflammation and bone loss around an implant, aiming to stop progression and stabilise the implant.\" data-pts=\"Early detection matters | Cleaning and decontamination | Close monitoring afterwards\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Peri-Implantitis Management<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"implant-maintenance\" data-title=\"Implant Maintenance\" data-desc=\"Regular professional care around implants, since implants need monitoring and cleaning just as natural teeth do.\" data-pts=\"Scheduled maintenance visits | Specific cleaning instruments | Home care technique reviewed\" data-cat=\"Periodontics\" data-catn=\"04\" data-catid=\"periodontics\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Implant Maintenance<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ===== 05. Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery ===== -->\r\n<section id=\"omfs\" data-svcsection=\"\" data-catid=\"omfs\" style=\"padding:clamp(48px,6vw,78px) 0;position:relative\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:1340px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px\">\r\n<div data-reveal=\"\" data-cathead=\"\">\r\n<span data-catnum=\"\" data-reveal-child=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05<\/span>\r\n<div data-reveal-child=\"\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0\">\r\n<h2 data-cattitle=\"\">Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery<\/h2>\r\n<div data-catmeta=\"\">\r\n<span data-catcount=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-briefcase-medical\" style=\"font-size:12px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>16 treatments<\/span>\r\n<span data-cattag=\"\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-star\" style=\"font-size:8px;color:#C2A469\"><\/i>Core specialty<\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p data-catlead=\"\">Surgical assessment and treatment involving the mouth, jaws and facial structures.<\/p>\r\n<span data-catrule=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div data-svcgridx=\"\" data-reveal=\"\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"wisdom-tooth-surgery\" data-title=\"Wisdom Tooth Surgery\" data-desc=\"Assessment and removal of wisdom teeth that are impacted, repeatedly infected or damaging the tooth in front of them.\" data-pts=\"Radiographs before any decision | Removal only when indicated | Clear aftercare instructions\" data-cat=\"Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery\" data-catn=\"05\" data-catid=\"omfs\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Wisdom Tooth Surgery<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"surgical-removal-impacted-teeth\" data-title=\"Surgical Removal of Impacted Teeth\" data-desc=\"Removal of teeth that have not erupted normally and lie under gum or bone, planned from imaging that shows the exact position.\" data-pts=\"Position mapped before surgery | Nerve proximity assessed | Recovery guidance provided\" data-cat=\"Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery\" data-catn=\"05\" data-catid=\"omfs\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Surgical Removal of Impacted Teeth<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"complex-extractions\" data-title=\"Complex Extractions\" data-desc=\"Removal of teeth that are broken down, curved rooted or otherwise difficult, using a surgical approach for a controlled result.\" data-pts=\"Surgical rather than simple approach | Planned from radiographs | Site preserved where possible\" data-cat=\"Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery\" data-catn=\"05\" data-catid=\"omfs\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Complex Extractions<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"retained-root-management\" data-title=\"Retained Root Management\" data-desc=\"Assessment and removal of root fragments left behind after a previous extraction or fracture, where they are causing problems.\" data-pts=\"Located on radiographs | Removed when symptomatic | Monitored when removal is riskier\" data-cat=\"Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery\" data-catn=\"05\" data-catid=\"omfs\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Retained Root Management<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"alveoloplasty\" data-title=\"Alveoloplasty\" data-desc=\"Smoothing and reshaping the jaw ridge after extractions so a denture or prosthesis can seat comfortably.\" data-pts=\"Prepares the ridge for dentures | Often done at extraction time | Improves prosthesis comfort\" data-cat=\"Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery\" data-catn=\"05\" data-catid=\"omfs\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Alveoloplasty<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"frenectomy\" data-title=\"Frenectomy\" data-desc=\"Release of a tight or high frenum that restricts tongue or lip movement, or that pulls on the gum and keeps a gap open between teeth.\" data-pts=\"Short procedure under anaesthesia | Helps tongue and lip movement | May support orthodontic results\" data-cat=\"Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery\" data-catn=\"05\" data-catid=\"omfs\"><span data-svcname=\"\">Frenectomy<\/span><span data-svcplus=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+<\/span><\/button>\r\n<button type=\"button\" data-svcitem=\"\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" data-slug=\"ora